WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.002 --> 00:00:03.461
By fall.

00:00:03.461 --> 00:00:06.756
The time has come for families
across the far south

00:00:06.756 --> 00:00:09.634
to leave their summer homes.

00:00:12.095 --> 00:00:15.640
But some are far from ready to say goodbye.

00:00:22.105 --> 00:00:25.233
After almost a year apart

00:00:25.233 --> 00:00:29.529
time together is precious.

00:00:34.576 --> 00:00:35.952
Like us,

00:00:36.119 --> 00:00:39.247
it can take years for albatross
to find their soulmate.

00:00:43.585 --> 00:00:46.129
And long distance romances

00:00:46.129 --> 00:00:48.381
take work.

00:00:56.014 --> 00:00:59.476
But it's all been worth it.

00:01:05.982 --> 00:01:08.943
At 75 days,

00:01:08.943 --> 00:01:11.863
wandering albatross
have one of the longest

00:01:11.863 --> 00:01:14.741
incubations of any bird.

00:01:22.123 --> 00:01:25.293
Until their egg hatches

00:01:25.293 --> 00:01:29.506
they'll have to feed in shifts.

00:01:39.015 --> 00:01:41.351
But our oceans are more dangerous

00:01:41.351 --> 00:01:44.104
than ever before.

00:01:52.612 --> 00:01:54.948
Every goodbye

00:01:55.615 --> 00:01:58.868
could be his last.

00:02:06.751 --> 00:02:10.088
And he's gone.

00:02:25.895 --> 00:02:27.522
Each year

00:02:27.522 --> 00:02:30.191
he's having to fly further and further

00:02:30.191 --> 00:02:33.486
to find enough food.

00:02:34.988 --> 00:02:37.448
Testing their relationship

00:02:37.448 --> 00:02:40.118
to the limit.

00:02:52.046 --> 00:02:56.259
Failure
to provide is now ending more and more

00:02:58.511 --> 00:03:00.430
of these epic

00:03:00.430 --> 00:03:03.266
love stories.

